  "steps": [
    "To a pan on medium heat add 1 tbsp butter, 1 bay leaf, 4 cloves chopped garlic, 2 chopped onions, Saute till the onions turn golden brown, 200g button mushrooms (stems and caps separated), 1 tsp salt, Cook for 5 min, until all the water evaporates.",
    "Meanwhile to a blender add 125g low fat paneer, 1/2 tsp salt, 1 tsp pepper, 1 tsp Oregano, 1 tsp Chillie flakes, 150ml Water, Blend it till smooth.",
    "Now Pour the paneer sauce over the mushrooms and cook for a 10 minutes until everything comes together, Add chopped coriander, 1/2 tsp of chaat masala, Mix well, Turn off the flame and finish with the juice of ½ lime (10ml)"
  ],
